{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY AND LEARN: Fun Learning Games for Kids!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY AND LEARN brings <strong>three fun and educational games</strong> for preschool to 1st grade! Your child can play exciting mini-games, practice key skills, unlock secret characters, and learn while having a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO OUT NOW!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only left clicks are needed\u2014simple, intuitive, and perfect for young learners!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC MATCH</strong> \u2013 Explore colors and shapes with a magical wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP INTO LEARNING</strong> \u2013 Help a little frog learn the alphabet, numbers, phonics, and sight words in a fun adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATH-CASTERS</strong> \u2013 Practice addition and subtraction while rising through the ranks of the League of Math!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game includes practice pages to reinforce learning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Match:</strong> Learn colors and shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Into Learning:</strong> Master letters, numbers, and sight words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math-Casters:</strong> Addition and subtraction with a built-in calculator.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat challenges, reach new levels, and unlock fun characters in each game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 original tracks</strong> composed with <strong>Sentient Pulse</strong>, playable in the music menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Learning Combined!</strong><br>PLAY AND LEARN makes early education exciting, engaging, and magical. Perfect for kids and stress-free for parents!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990520?t=1761027728","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990520/52295aa0a3d8df9e182e29e67f61badcf0d0fbc9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761027728","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990520/155d0b8be34b235aa0ff1295253ecb99d3e96ec6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761027728","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990520/155d0b8be34b235aa0ff1295253ecb99d3e96ec6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761027728","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4035490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY AND LEARN: Fun Learning Games for Kids!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY AND LEARN brings <strong>three fun and educational games</strong> for preschool to 1st grade! Your child can play exciting mini-games, practice key skills, unlock secret characters, and learn while having a blast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEMO OUT NOW!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only left clicks are needed\u2014simple, intuitive, and perfect for young learners!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAGIC MATCH</strong> \u2013 Explore colors and shapes with a magical wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LEAP INTO LEARNING</strong> \u2013 Help a little frog learn the alphabet, numbers, phonics, and sight words in a fun adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MATH-CASTERS</strong> \u2013 Practice addition and subtraction while rising through the ranks of the League of Math!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Practice Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each game includes practice pages to reinforce learning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic Match:</strong> Learn colors and shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Into Learning:</strong> Master letters, numbers, and sight words.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Math-Casters:</strong> Addition and subtraction with a built-in calculator.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockable Characters &amp; Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat challenges, reach new levels, and unlock fun characters in each game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Original Music</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>12 original tracks</strong> composed with <strong>Sentient Pulse</strong>, playable in the music menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun and Learning Combined!</strong><br>PLAY AND LEARN makes early education exciting, engaging, and magical. Perfect for kids and stress-free for parents!</p>","developers":["NorShark"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990520/d98bc73cb80bfa691465b79c8825c1d0ba061a21/header.jpg?t=1761027728","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3990520/759393214/a6460ea5f8bfda737084423bb5a389b66a1ab393/1759207876/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759211329","dash_h264":"https://